## Fonts loaded from a CDN

The landing page loads variable fonts from jsDelivr at runtime rather than
bundling them:

  Inter            SIL Open Font License 1.1
  JetBrains Mono   SIL Open Font License 1.1

No font binaries are stored in this repository.


## Article text is a separate, CC BY-SA work

The articles the device serves are adapted from English Wikipedia and are not
part of this repository, apart from the device's own guide under
articles/pocketwiki/ and the two sample articles under tests/fixtures/. The
Wikipedia-derived text lives in the companion pocketwiki-content repository and
is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0, not MIT. Attribution details are recorded in that
repository's ATTRIBUTION.md.


